<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">E: <U STYLE="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none">ir@akandacorp.com</U></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

